      "id": "linear_ch2p2_0001",
      "q": "Compute the determinant of the matrix\n$$F=\\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta & -\\sin\\theta \\\\ \\sin\\theta & \\cos\\theta \\end{bmatrix}$$",
      "t": [
        "تمرين",
        "Cofactor Expansion"
      ],
      "c": [
        {
          "i": "1",
          "x": "$1$"
        },
        {
          "i": "2",
          "x": "$0$"
        },
        {
          "i": "3",
          "x": "$\\cos 2\\theta$"
        },
        {
          "i": "4",
          "x": "$-1$"
        }
      ],
      "a": "1",
      "e": [
        "نطبق $ad-bc$: $\\det(F)=(\\cos\\theta)(\\cos\\theta)-(-\\sin\\theta)(\\sin\\theta)$.",
        "$=\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta$ (لاحظ أن $-(-\\sin\\theta)(\\sin\\theta)=+\\sin^2\\theta$).",
        "وباستخدام المتطابقة الأساسية $\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta=1$ نحصل على $\\det(F)=1$ لكل قيم $\\theta$."
      ],
      "ref": "Ch2 §2.1 - Ex 3(vi)"
    },
    {
      "id": "linear_ch2p2_0002",
      "q": "Use the Arrow Technique to compute\n$$\\begin{vmatrix} -1 & 8 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 4 \\end{vmatrix}$$",
      "t": [
        "تمرين",
        "Cofactor Expansion"
      ],
      "c": [
